.wscubetech.com\/blog\/types-of-ai-agents\/#faq-question-1784809065767\",\"name\":\"7. Is it hard to build an AI agent?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"It depends on the type. Simple reflex agents are easy to build with basic rules. Learning agents and multi-agent systems require more technical skill, data, and testing, but many no-code tools now make even these more accessible to beginners.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/types-of-ai-agents\/#faq-question-1784809080562\",\"position\":8,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/types-of-ai-agents\/#faq-question-1784809080562\",\"name\":\"8. Which AI agent type is used in ChatGPT?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"ChatGPT\u00a0mainly works\u00a0as a language model and can power conversational AI agents. When connected to tools, memory, or workflows, it can also function like an advanced AI agent for completing tasks.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/types-of-ai-agents\/#faq-question-1784809095960\",\"position\":9,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/types-of-ai-agents\/#faq-question-1784809095960\",\"name\":\"9. Where are AI agents used?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"AI agents are used in customer support, healthcare, finance, education, marketing, software development, e-commerce, and manufacturing. They automate tasks, answer questions,\u00a0analyze\u00a0data, and improve productivity across industries.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/types-of-ai-agents\/#faq-question-1784809112069\",\"position\":10,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/types-of-ai-agents\/#faq-question-1784809112069\",\"name\":\"10. Can AI agents work together?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Multiple AI agents can work together by sharing information and dividing tasks. This multi-agent approach helps solve complex problems faster and improves overall efficiency and decision-making.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/types-of-ai-agents\/#faq-question-1784809127961\",\"position\":11,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/types-of-ai-agents\/#faq-question-1784809127961\",\"name\":\"11. Will AI agents replace human jobs?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"AI agents will automate many repetitive tasks, but they are more likely to support people than fully replace them. Human creativity, critical thinking, and decision-making remain valuable in most industries.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/types-of-ai-agents\/#faq-question-1784809142214\",\"position\":12,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/types-of-ai-agents\/#faq-question-1784809142214\",\"name\":\"12. What skills are needed to build AI agents?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Building AI agents requires programming knowledge, machine learning basics, prompt engineering, API integration, problem-solving, and understanding of AI frameworks, automation tools, and data handling for real-world applications.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"}]}<\/script>\n<!-- \/ Yoast SEO plugin. -->","yoast_head_json":{"title":"7 Types of AI Agents: Definitions & Examples (2026 Guide)","description":"Discover the types of AI agents with examples, use cases, pros, cons, and comparisons. Choose the right AI agent for your needs. Read now!","robots":{"index":"index","follow":"follow","max-snippet":"max-snippet:-1","max-image-preview":"max-im